            "line": 580,
            "text": "theorem fluxHistory_exterior (h lam : ℝ) {u : JointProfile} (hu : ContDiff ℝ ∞ u) {B : ℝ}\n    (hB : 0 ≤ B) (hs : ∀ eta R, B ≤ R → u (R, eta) = 0)\n    (hm : ∀ eta, positiveIntegral (fun R => R * u (R, eta)) = 0)\n    {R eta : ℝ} (hR : B ≤ R) : fluxHistory h lam u (R, eta) = 0"
          }
